# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# US2 — "and" between two word groups detection (AC2)
# "and" triggers only when flanked by a word group on both sides (case-insensitive).
# Leading/trailing "and" (e.g. "and Smith", "John and") does NOT trigger.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

